CLAUDE.md

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# Tooling
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Regenerable training snapshots (data/ is otherwise committed and is the source of truth)
data/processed/*
!data/processed/.gitkeep

# Notebooks are exploration only, nothing here is load-bearing
notebooks/.ipynb_checkpoints/

# Local secrets (odds API key comes from GitHub Actions secrets in CI)
.env

# Model artifacts: regenerated by every retrain, never a source of truth
data/models/

# The site is a generated view over data/ and is rebuilt from scratch by the deploy job, which
# uploads it straight to Pages. Committing 24 HTML files that change on every run only created
# rebase conflicts in files nobody ever merges.
site/

# wrangler's local build cache for tools/cloudflare-worker/. Regenerated by every `wrangler
# deploy`/`dev`, never a source of truth, and never holds the secret (that lives in Cloudflare,
# via `wrangler secret put` — see tools/cloudflare-worker/README.md).
.wrangler/
